{
  "slug": "zac",
  "name": "Zac",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin for Human-In-The-Loop iterative development with progressive disclosure and deterministic workflow orchestration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**, **1 agent** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `dev-loop` (Autonomous develop-and-verify loop — autopilot implements, run verifies, repeats until CURRENT item complete, then stops), `dev-status` (Read-only project state viewer — shows current iteration, cycle history, document index, and quick stats), `e2e-walkthrough` (Simulates human web usage by reading project docs, constructing realistic user journeys, verifying each step via Playwright screenshots…), `fix`, `pre-dev` (Pre-development orchestrator — brainstorm, delegate, validate, and gate through spec → roadmap → toolchain), `progressive-plan` (Break a roadmap functional point into 5-7 executable function items — MVP-priority selection across branches, prototype-driven vertical slices,…), `run` (Continuous quality-gate runner — checks, edge-case tests, walkthrough, auto-fixes, and commits when green), `scaffold` (文档驱动的环境搭建 — 基于 pre-dev 文档和仓库现状构建可开发可测试的环境，不确定时与用户讨论), and 3 more\n- **Agents** (1): `study-agent` (Research topics, teach interactively, build minimal demos, and generate structured learning notes in the project knowledge base (notes/))\n- **Hooks** (2): `Stop`, `StopFailure`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install zac@claude-community` from `im-zhong/zac`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 11,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 2
  },
